fix(nav_list): rows that fit pass the wheel on to the container

A NavList took every vertical notch (Consumed when it could not move),
so a sidebar laid out whole inside a scrolled page stopped the page's
wheel over it. While its rows fit it now ignores the notch, as a
ScrollPane does (scroll chaining). Regression test fails before.

